# Icons Directory

Place your icon assets here:
- SVG icons
- Favicon files
- App icons
- Social media icons

## Recommended Structure
- `/svg/` - Vector icons (SVG)
- `/favicon/` - Favicon variants
- `/social/` - Social media icons

## Usage in Blade
```blade
<img src="{{ asset('assets/icons/icon-name.svg') }}" alt="Icon">
```
